  "notes": "Eagle High Plantations (BWPT, fka BW Plantation Tbk) — IDX-listed Indonesian pure-play CPO/PK producer, ~116k planted ha, ~287k acres total concessions. IPO Oct 2009 as BW Plantation. Acquired by Rajawali Group in 2014, rebranded Eagle High Plantations 2015 after merger with Green Eagle Holdings (large Kalimantan/Papua estates) — planted area expanded from ~38k ha (2009) to ~116k ha (2016+). Distressed balance sheet — debt restructured 2018-2020. Reports under PSAK 69 (biological assets at FV). Quarterly + FY filings via IDX. Values in IDR millions. Pure CPO/PK segment with minor 'other' (rubber/by-products) line. Net debt remained elevated (Rp4-5T) through cycle, equity base small relative to debt → high leverage. FY filings authoritative, quarterly EBITDA estimated from filed gross profit + D&A where line-item EBITDA not directly disclosed. Pre-2020 history sourced from BWPT/EHP annual report 5-year summaries (Eagle High IR archive) and IDX laporan keuangan archive — annual only as quarterly archives sparse.",
